(2)   20/  C19990 :                     ; Points the background sprite's tilemap (SPR_BG, 20x16 tiles) at either the
(2)   21/  C19990 :                     ; custom bg tile range (256+, filled by LoadCustomBG) or the default repeating
(2)   22/  C19990 :                     ; pattern, depending on CustomBGLoaded. Also (re)applies the sprite's Z/Y/X.
(2)   23/  C19990 :                     ; Safe to call again after the menu is already up, e.g. once a per-game bg.bmp
(2)   24/  C19990 :                     ; has just been loaded by LoadGameBG.
